01:31.850 --> 01:35.070
Rivaul injured himself in front of the goal and is now leaving the field.

01:32.660 --> 01:37.420
-Spain - Cataluña Stadium -

01:35.880 --> 01:38.060
Ohzora Tsubasa is preparing to enter.

01:49.070 --> 01:52.180
Tsubasa, go out there and have fun!

01:59.060 --> 02:01.740
Tsubasa!

02:09.740 --> 02:11.150
This is it!

02:11.150 --> 02:13.540
This is where I belong!

02:16.960 --> 02:19.060
Awesome! Tsubasa gets to play!

02:19.550 --> 02:23.060
Go out there and score lots of goals!

02:23.410 --> 02:28.620
Hey, that Tsubasa. Is he the Tsubasa from Cataluña's B team?

02:28.620 --> 02:34.650
The guy who met Coach Edward's challenge of ten goals and ten assists

02:35.510 --> 02:40.100
in only three games since the start of the season?

02:40.100 --> 02:41.440
That's him.

02:41.440 --> 02:42.900
You sure know your stuff.

02:43.430 --> 02:44.910
Of course!

02:44.910 --> 02:47.140
Everybody here knows about it.

02:47.140 --> 02:48.010
Isn't that right?

02:48.010 --> 02:49.450
Yeah!

02:48.920 --> 02:49.450
Tsubasa!

02:49.450 --> 02:50.300
He's awesome!

02:50.300 --> 02:51.140
Tsubasa!

02:51.140 --> 02:54.920
I see that I'm not the only fan of Tsubasa anymore.

02:54.920 --> 02:58.790
Everybody here at Cataluña is!

02:59.380 --> 03:00.540
Kid!

03:01.000 --> 03:02.540
Come on, let's cheer for him!

03:03.170 --> 03:04.260
Yes!

03:04.880 --> 03:07.290
Fight, Tsubasa!

03:07.290 --> 03:07.860
Go!

03:07.860 --> 03:11.860
Ohzora Tsubasa, from Japan, is finally coming onto the field.

03:11.860 --> 03:14.910
All right, Tsubasa. Do your best!

03:15.420 --> 03:19.250
Tsubasa, you're finally on the field of the main stadium.

03:19.940 --> 03:22.640
You're finally here, Tsubasa.

03:22.640 --> 03:29.950
I was once named the Soccer Cyborg, and I played only to win.

03:30.830 --> 03:36.400
By going up against you, 
my hot passion for soccer was reborn.

03:36.400 --> 03:38.940
I'm happy to be able to go up against you again.

03:46.980 --> 03:52.100
<b>Warriors on the Field</b>

03:46.980 --> 03:52.100
<b>Warriors on the Field</b>

03:52.760 --> 03:56.140
Will Ohzora Tsubasa, the first Japanese player in the Spanish League,

03:56.140 --> 04:00.060
be able to replace the team leader, Rivaul?

04:01.540 --> 04:05.060
I'm up against Santana on this field.

04:06.820 --> 04:08.020
The game resumes.

04:08.870 --> 04:10.360
It's the best feeling!

04:10.360 --> 04:12.860
Isn't it, Santana?

04:17.660 --> 04:18.460
Go!

04:24.700 --> 04:28.060
The ball has been passed to Albert on the left side.

04:31.890 --> 04:34.180
Albert dribbles up the left side.

04:34.180 --> 04:35.180
Let's do this!

04:35.180 --> 04:35.940
All right!

04:38.000 --> 04:40.460
The ball gets passed to the opposite side with a long pass.

04:44.220 --> 04:46.420
Bernhardt goes to receive the ball on the right side...

04:46.420 --> 04:49.780
Oh, it's Santana! Santana steals it!

04:49.780 --> 04:51.020
It's not over yet!

04:53.500 --> 04:58.110
Great play! What a nice pass to evade the defender!

05:01.210 --> 05:02.500
All right, here I go!

05:03.110 --> 05:04.540
Sliding tackle from Alaberdo!

05:05.200 --> 05:07.150
Santana evades it!

05:12.480 --> 05:16.540
Now that Rivaul isn't playing, 
we have no choice but to go up against him.

05:16.540 --> 05:17.740
I'm going!

05:24.620 --> 05:28.620
He's been caught by Clemente's Snake Marking.

05:28.620 --> 05:30.430
Awesome, keep that up!

05:30.430 --> 05:31.380
Strangle him!

05:32.550 --> 05:34.100
I won't let you escape!

05:38.150 --> 05:41.750
Oh, Santana kicks the ball into an empty space.

05:41.750 --> 05:42.460
Good.

05:43.440 --> 05:45.180
Continue to mark him. It's too early to let him go!

05:48.180 --> 05:50.660
The ball comes back to him at an incredible speed!

05:50.660 --> 05:52.220
(a run-around play)

05:50.660 --> 05:52.220
It's a big bridge! {I'd like to mention "run-around" as a note (from Reed's QC report) in this line, but don't know how.}

05:52.220 --> 05:54.340
Just what I expected from you, Santana.

05:54.340 --> 05:57.550
Santana is in front of Cataluña's goal!

05:57.550 --> 05:59.780
Damn it! Don't act big.

06:00.470 --> 06:03.370
We'll show you what the defenders of Cataluña are made of!

06:04.900 --> 06:06.900
He's doing a Santana Turn?

06:06.900 --> 06:08.100
He's going for the through pass!

06:16.700 --> 06:17.420
What?

06:18.290 --> 06:21.540
Incredible! He passed two players doing another big bridge!

06:21.540 --> 06:26.580
We might as well call it a Super Bridge, since that trick is so god-like!

06:28.390 --> 06:31.410
And now he gets ready to shoot.

06:32.380 --> 06:33.950
Go in!

06:36.180 --> 06:36.900
It's been cleared!

06:37.650 --> 06:40.900
What a fine play by Ohzora Tsubasa who came back home to defend!

06:40.900 --> 06:42.140
Good.

06:45.140 --> 06:46.910
Incredible, Tsubasa-kun!

06:48.420 --> 06:50.020
Way to do it, Tsubasa!

06:56.580 --> 06:57.910
The ball reaches the center!

06:59.660 --> 07:00.720
Tsubasa!

07:00.720 --> 07:01.300
Tsubasa!

07:01.300 --> 07:03.220
Grandios-san!

07:03.220 --> 07:04.220
You got it!

07:07.150 --> 07:09.450
Grandios passes the ball to Ohzora.

07:09.450 --> 07:10.580
Albert-san.

07:10.580 --> 07:12.300
Yes!

07:12.300 --> 07:13.420
No way I'm letting you!

07:20.260 --> 07:22.140
Bernhardt-san, please go up the field!

07:22.970 --> 07:23.620
Yeah!

07:28.830 --> 07:30.340
Tsubasa does a big bridge!

07:33.060 --> 07:34.500
He's good!

07:39.850 --> 07:42.300
Tsubasa, I'm counting on you!

07:55.140 --> 07:59.580
Wow! Santana has gotten all the way back to stop Tsubasa!

08:01.860 --> 08:03.420
Did he mess up the trapping of the ball?

08:03.420 --> 08:04.750
What?

08:04.750 --> 08:07.460
He passed, predicting that the ball would bounce off my leg?

08:07.460 --> 08:09.020
I see.

08:09.020 --> 08:12.240
It's a killer pass using Santana's leg.

08:12.240 --> 08:15.140
That was quite an idea, Tsubasa!

08:15.710 --> 08:20.140
The ball luckily lands near Bernhardt. Will he shoot?

08:20.140 --> 08:21.290
Damn it!

08:23.550 --> 08:25.220
I'm leaving it to you, Tsubasa!

08:45.540 --> 08:46.700
Good!

08:47.150 --> 08:49.700
Goal! Goal! Goal!

08:49.700 --> 08:52.630
2 - 2. It's the equalizer!

08:52.630 --> 08:57.410
Ohzora Tsubasa, from Japan, evens the score with that last-ditch effort!

09:01.130 --> 09:01.800
Tsubasa!

09:03.590 --> 09:05.460
That was cool, Tsubasa!

09:05.460 --> 09:07.620
You're the best, Tsubasa!

09:08.260 --> 09:09.980
Let's go score one more!

09:09.980 --> 09:10.910
Yes!

09:11.690 --> 09:12.830
Tsubasa.

09:14.380 --> 09:15.900
You're as good as ever.

09:15.900 --> 09:18.060
You, too.

09:18.060 --> 09:21.390
The game has only just begun.

09:22.000 --> 09:22.930
Yeah.

09:29.430 --> 09:36.140
I will never forget the day I joined the first team.

09:36.500 --> 09:39.380
All right! Way to go, Tsubasa!

09:39.730 --> 09:41.530
You did it, Tsubasa!

09:41.530 --> 09:45.420
This is a new start for you.

09:45.420 --> 09:46.840
He did it!

09:47.910 --> 09:51.100
Tsubasa-kun, I'm rooting for you.

09:59.720 --> 10:04.110
The best players in the world know how to use every opportunity to score goals.

10:04.690 --> 10:08.700
Tsubasa, you belong with those players.

10:11.500 --> 10:13.560
This is his first Division I game,

10:14.270 --> 10:18.340
yet his marvelous play rivals that of Rivaul.

10:19.010 --> 10:21.750
It's been worth waiting for this day!

10:27.950 --> 10:30.620
You're sure showing your stuff, Tsubasa.

10:31.560 --> 10:35.470
Be sure to take this chance to show what you've got during the time I'm injured.

10:36.910 --> 10:38.800
And you, Santana,

10:38.800 --> 10:44.100
I didn't know a player like you existed in Brazil after I left.

10:45.260 --> 10:47.140
I've decided, Tsubasa.

10:48.030 --> 10:51.860
I will be going, together with Santana, to your country

10:52.630 --> 10:54.740
to play at the International Cup

10:55.690 --> 10:59.480
and to challenge the Japanese team you're leading.

11:00.260 --> 11:05.020
That will be a duel between us, the two playmakers!

11:13.580 --> 11:16.900
-Turin- Italy

11:17.620 --> 11:20.860
Piemonte Stadium

11:23.790 --> 11:27.480
Piemonte's Willem continues to fight in the middle of the field.

11:27.480 --> 11:31.450
But he's having a hard time and isn't able to reach the goal.

11:41.720 --> 11:46.020
There are now only six minutes left, and the score is still tied at 0-0.

11:46.020 --> 11:49.960
Who will the goddess of victory smile upon today?

12:01.900 --> 12:04.650
Hyuga-kun, make sure to leave a good impression!

12:07.830 --> 12:08.660
Hyuga,

12:09.240 --> 12:12.380
you'll be playing the last five minutes of this game.

12:12.380 --> 12:15.440
I want results in these last five minutes!

12:15.440 --> 12:16.620
Yes!

12:23.340 --> 12:26.650
Oh! Piemonte makes a player substitution.

12:27.660 --> 12:29.510
And here's Hyuga!

12:29.510 --> 12:31.660
Hyuga Kojiro enters!

12:31.660 --> 12:32.670
All right.

12:45.040 --> 12:48.260
Willem keeps the ball and runs up the right side.

12:49.960 --> 12:52.140
Come on, Willem!

12:52.900 --> 12:56.780
Show me you've changed, Hyuga!

13:01.650 --> 13:03.980
This ain't the old me!

13:08.470 --> 13:10.220
Looks like you've been working out.

13:13.460 --> 13:16.740
I know all about your weakness, <i>giapponese!</i>

13:16.740 --> 13:17.650
What's that!?

13:22.660 --> 13:23.660
What!?

13:23.660 --> 13:25.270
You're not doing bad.

13:31.420 --> 13:32.570
There's your result.

13:33.160 --> 13:37.730
I did all that training, so I could get a spot on this team.

13:45.050 --> 13:46.840
Lift both legs together!

13:48.010 --> 13:50.180
Continue like that.

13:57.220 --> 14:00.180
Pedal with all you've got the last 40 seconds.

14:00.670 --> 14:01.710
Yes!

14:06.430 --> 14:07.140
I'm not letting you!

14:07.900 --> 14:08.750
Willem!

14:10.500 --> 14:12.820
Hyuga passes the ball back to Willem!

14:20.440 --> 14:23.270
All right, show me if you're the real deal!

14:25.580 --> 14:28.880
I'll show you my power!

14:34.810 --> 14:36.780
Goal!

14:38.430 --> 14:39.860
All right!

14:39.860 --> 14:41.420
Yes!

14:41.420 --> 14:44.560
Hyuga scores a goal thanks to his powerful shot!

14:44.560 --> 14:47.780
It's his first goal in Italy!

14:50.000 --> 14:52.140
Hyuga-kun, keep it up.

14:55.220 --> 14:58.180
And now the game's over.

14:58.180 --> 15:04.020
FC Piemonte wins, thanks to a goal scored by Hyuga right at the end of added time!

15:05.270 --> 15:10.660
I'll admit it, Hyuga... you've become a real <i>giocatore.</i>

15:18.750 --> 15:20.250
I will...

15:20.250 --> 15:22.420
continue to aim for the top!

15:22.980 --> 15:26.900
-Germany- Rotburg

15:25.200 --> 15:30.020
The last game in the German League is between FC Rotburg and FC Grünwald.

15:27.980 --> 15:31.900
Kaiser Stadium

15:30.020 --> 15:32.410
Who will be crowned the champion for this season?

15:32.410 --> 15:36.940
The fated battle for the title has begun!

15:40.000 --> 15:43.660
I will beat you and take the title.

15:43.660 --> 15:44.730
Here we go, Schneider!

15:46.780 --> 15:47.740
Darn it!

15:48.550 --> 15:50.270
I'm going for it, Wakabayashi!

15:51.580 --> 15:52.500
Come!

15:52.500 --> 15:54.550
Here it comes!

16:05.880 --> 16:07.420
Let's counterattack!

16:14.500 --> 16:15.640
Schneider,

16:15.640 --> 16:19.460
I will beat you and become the best goalkeeper in the world.

16:21.780 --> 16:24.020
No, not only that.

16:24.020 --> 16:27.910
I will continue the fight so that Japan become world champions!

16:29.380 --> 16:33.020
-France- Paris

16:46.490 --> 16:48.480
The big day is finally here.

16:55.180 --> 16:56.580
Tsubasa-kun,

16:56.580 --> 17:01.050
our dream of playing in the International Cup

17:01.050 --> 17:02.900
is finally close.

17:13.000 --> 17:15.620
Yay! I can't wait!

17:15.620 --> 17:18.400
I'm so excited!

17:18.400 --> 17:22.020
I'll be able to fight together with Tsubasa-san again!

17:32.430 --> 17:35.040
The International Cup is starting soon.

17:37.190 --> 17:38.140
Your aim is?

17:39.810 --> 17:42.180
Of course, to win it all!

